n-names></name><name><surname>Tau</surname><given-names>KR</given-names></name><name><surname>Qian</surname><given-names>Q</given-names></name><name><surname>Skarhus</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>TF</given-names></name><name><surname>Persing</surname><given-names>DH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effective use of polymerase chain reaction for diagnosis of central nervous system infections</article-title><source>Clin Infect Dis</source><year>1999</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>803</fpage><lpage>806</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10589893</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1086/520439</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>